                select m.period, m.recorder_name, apex_page.get_url(p_page => m.page_id, p_items => 'P' || m.page_id || '_ID', p_values => m.recorder_id) recorder_url,
                       m.organization_name, m.place_kind_name, m.place_name, m.currency_code, m.incoming, m.outgoing, m.content
                  from v_cash_movement m
                 where (:P360_ORG is null or m.organization_id = :P360_ORG)
                ```
